  "description": "The family Serilog baseline as a LoggerConfiguration extension: WithDefaults() attaches the enrichers every app shares (log context, thread, process, exception details) plus the Version and Application properties read from the entry assembly, which a configuration file cannot express. The host keeps its own AddSerilog call, and sinks and levels stay in the \"Serilog\" configuration section",
